      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "cue_acid",
      "narration": "That acid seeps into cracks in the limestone and slowly dissolves it.",
      "on_screen_text": "It dissolves limestone",
      "highlight_words": [
        "limestone"
      ],
      "sfx": "none",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "cue_carve",
      "narration": "After thousands or millions of years, the cracks become tunnels and huge chambers.",
      "on_screen_text": "From cracks to caves",
      "highlight_words": [
        "caves"
      ],
      "sfx": "riser",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "cue_drip",
      "narration": "Inside the cave, every drop hanging from the ceiling leaves behind a tiny ring of mineral called calcite.",
      "on_screen_text": "Every drop leaves calcite",
      "highlight_words": [
        "calcite"
      ],
      "sfx": "bubbles",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "cue_stalactite",
      "narration": "Ring after ring, a stalactite grows downward.",
      "on_screen_text": "Stalactite: hangs down",
      "highlight_words": [
        "Stalactite:"
      ],
      "sfx": "none",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "cue_stalagmite",
      "narration": "And where the drop hits the floor, a stalagmite grows upward.",
      "on_screen_text": "Stalagmite: grows up",
      "highlight_words": [
        "Stalagmite:"
      ],
      "sfx": "pop",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "cue_column",
      "narration": "They grow very slowly, often just a centimeter or two per century, but given enough time they meet and form a column.",
      "on_screen_text": "They meet: a column",
